%% Proposed publishing workflow (status values already exist in src/types/news.ts L80)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: Reporter/Editor creates
  draft --> pending_review: Reporter submits
  pending_review --> draft: Editor returns with notes
  pending_review --> scheduled: Editor sets scheduledFor
  pending_review --> published: Editor publishes
  draft --> published: Editor/Admin publishes directly
  scheduled --> published: Server job at scheduledFor (proposed)
  published --> published: Update (dateModified, revision saved)
  published --> archived: Editor unpublishes
  archived --> draft: Editor restores
  archived --> [*]: Admin deletes
